{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24922","headline":"曲江亭望慈恩寺杏园花发 · 周弘亮","name":"曲江亭望慈恩寺杏园花发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江亭闲望处，远近见秦源。\n古寺迟春景，新花发杏园。\n萼中轻蘂密，枝上素姿繁。\n拂雨云初起，含风雪欲翻。\n容辉明十地，香气遍千门。\n愿莫随桃李，芳菲不爲言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周弘亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}